 ```
 
+`createPatch(from, to)` creates an RFC 6902 JSON Patch that changes one JSON
+document into another. It emits operations at the smallest changed object or
+array locations rather than replacing an unchanged surrounding document, and
+does not modify either input.
+
+```ts
+import { createPatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+createPatch({ profile: { name: "Ada" } }, { profile: { name: "Lin" } });
+// [{ op: "replace", path: "/profile/name", value: "Lin" }]
+```
+
